#: ../developer/releases.md:1
msgid "Releases and upgrades"
msgstr "发布与升级"

#: ../developer/releases.md:3
msgid ""
"Run an installation you operate from a published release; contributions "
"target `dev`. This page covers telling what is running and planning an "
"upgrade. Setup is in [Installation](installation.md) and the service "
"commands in [Deployment](deployment.md)."
msgstr ""
"自己运维的部署请基于已发布的版本运行；贡献代码请提交到 "
"`dev`。本页讲怎样确认正在运行的是哪个版本，以及怎样规划升级。安装见[安装](installation.md)，服务操作命令见[部署](deployment.md)。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:8
msgid "Release identity and support"
msgstr "版本标识与支持"

#: ../developer/releases.md:10
msgid ""
"Releases are [GitHub "
"releases](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/releases) "
"tagged with the UTC date, `YYYYMMDD`, plus `.1`, `.2` and so on for "
"further releases that day. They are dated snapshots, not semantic-version"
" promises. A maintainer cuts one by moving `main` up to a commit on "
"`dev`, and the `Release` workflow publishes it with generated notes."
msgstr ""
"版本以 [GitHub "
"release](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/releases) "
"形式发布，标签为 UTC 日期 `YYYYMMDD`，同一天再发布则加 `.1`、`.2` "
"等后缀。它们是带日期的快照，不承诺语义化版本兼容。维护者把 `main` 前移到 `dev` 上的某个提交即发布一个版本，`Release` "
"工作流随后带上自动生成的说明发布它。"

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid "Identifier"
msgstr "标识"

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid "What it tells you"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid "A published date tag"
msgstr "已发布的日期 tag"

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid "A fixed source snapshot with GitHub release notes"
msgstr "带有 GitHub 发布说明的固定源码快照"

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid "`main`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid ""
"The branch maintainers move up to `dev` for each release; it moves over "
"time"
msgstr "维护者每次发版时推进到 `dev` 的分支，会随时间变化"

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid "`dev` or a feature branch"
msgstr "`dev` 或功能分支"

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid "Development work that may be newer than the latest release"
msgstr "开发中的代码，可能比最新的发布版本还新"

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid "A full commit SHA"
msgstr "完整 commit SHA"

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid "The exact source revision; report local modifications separately"
msgstr "确切的源码修订；本地改动另行说明"

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid "An image digest, `image@sha256:…`"
msgstr "镜像摘要，`image@sha256:…`"

#: ../developer/releases.md
msgid "The exact container artifact, which may differ from the host checkout"
msgstr "确切的容器产物，可能和宿主机上检出的代码不一致"

#: ../developer/releases.md:24
msgid ""
"Container images are published only for releases: when `main` moves, CI "
"builds the backend and console images and, once that run is green, "
"publishes them tagged `sha-<full-sha>`, with short-SHA aliases. An "
"unreleased `dev` commit has no published image; build it from source. "
"Images published earlier carry `dev-<full-sha>` tags. The `0.1.0` in "
"`pyproject.toml` and `apps/frontend/package.json` identifies no build."
msgstr ""
"容器镜像只为发布版本发布：`main` 前移时，CI 构建后端和控制台镜像，这次运行通过后，以 `sha-<full-sha>` 标签和短 SHA"
" 别名发布它们。未发布的 `dev` 提交没有已发布的镜像，请从源码构建。更早发布的镜像使用 `dev-<full-sha>` "
"标签。`pyproject.toml` 和 `apps/frontend/package.json` 里的 `0.1.0` 不标识任何构建。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:31
msgid ""
"Report problems against the latest release when you can. Fixes land on "
"`dev` and reach a later release; there is no LTS branch, backport window "
"or response-time commitment. For an older version, include its exact "
"revision and whether the latest release has the problem too. Report "
"security issues as [the security "
"policy](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/dev/SECURITY.md)"
" describes."
msgstr ""
"尽量基于最新版本报告问题。修复会先合入 `dev`，随后续版本发布；没有 LTS "
"分支、回移窗口或响应时间承诺。报告旧版本的问题时，请附上确切修订，并说明最新版本是否也有这个问题。安全问题请按[安全策略](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/dev/SECURITY.md)报告。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:38
msgid "Include the version in a bug report"
msgstr "在 bug 报告中附上版本"

#: ../developer/releases.md:40
msgid "In the checkout used to build or start the service:"
msgstr "在用于构建或启动服务的检出目录中运行："

#: ../developer/releases.md:48
msgid ""
"The second command fails when HEAD is not exactly a tag; report the SHA "
"then. Mention local changes without pasting secrets or private "
"configuration."
msgstr "HEAD 不恰好是某个标签时，第二条命令会报错，这时报告 SHA 即可。说明本地改动时不要贴出密钥或私有配置。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:51
msgid "For the Compose stack, report the running images:"
msgstr "对于 Compose 服务栈，报告正在运行的镜像："

#: ../developer/releases.md:58
msgid ""
"Use your container names if they differ, and include any pinned image "
"digests. The console footer shows the console's build SHA when one was "
"supplied at build time (`build dev` or `local build` means none was); "
"report the backend revision separately."
msgstr ""
"容器名不同时换成你自己的，并附上所有固定的镜像摘要。构建时提供了 SHA 的话，控制台页脚会显示控制台的构建 SHA（显示 `build dev`"
" 或 `local build` 表示没有提供）；后端修订请另行报告。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:63
msgid "Compatibility and breaking changes"
msgstr "兼容性与破坏性变更"

#: ../developer/releases.md:65
msgid ""
"Read the notes and linked PRs of every release between your version and "
"the target. A date tag does not establish compatibility, and OpenAI "
"compatibility does not cover every provider extension; check the "
"endpoints, streaming and model settings your clients use."
msgstr ""
"阅读当前版本与目标版本之间每个版本的说明和关联 PR。日期标签本身不代表兼容，OpenAI 兼容也不涵盖每个 provider "
"扩展；请检查客户端用到的接口、流式输出和模型设置。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:70
msgid ""
"If you change an HTTP contract, authentication, a setting or "
"configuration document, a default or the database schema, state the old "
"and new behavior in the PR: who must act, the configuration or migration "
"steps, and whether the previous version can still use the resulting data."
" Mark breaking changes in the PR and the release notes; generated commit "
"summaries do not tell an operator how to upgrade."
msgstr ""
"如果你改动了 HTTP 契约、认证、设置项或配置文档、默认值或数据库 schema，请在 PR "
"中写明新旧行为：谁需要采取行动、配置或迁移步骤，以及旧版本能否继续使用改动后的数据。在 PR "
"和发布说明中明确标注破坏性变更；自动生成的提交摘要不会告诉运维人员怎样升级。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:77
msgid "Upgrade and rollback"
msgstr "升级与回滚"

#: ../developer/releases.md:79
msgid ""
"Record the current and target revisions, the backend and console image "
"identities, and the active distribution. Keep the previous images so that"
" a rollback needs no rebuild."
msgstr "记录当前和目标修订、后端和控制台镜像的标识以及当前发行版。保留旧镜像，回滚时就不必重新构建。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:82
msgid ""
"Read the target's configuration requirements. Merge changes into the "
"deployment's existing `.env`, overlay and secrets instead of replacing "
"them with example files. An upgrade never rotates secrets: changing "
"`JWT_SECRET_KEY` signs everyone out, changing `API_KEY_SECRET` breaks "
"every API key, and changing `ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET` (or `API_KEY_SECRET` "
"while it stands in for it) stops the backend from starting. Keep the "
"`.env` you upgraded from until rollback is no longer an option; see "
"[Upgrading a deployment that kept its settings in "
"`.env`](deployment.md#upgrading-a-deployment-that-kept-its-settings-in-"
"env)."
msgstr ""
"阅读目标版本的配置要求。把改动合并进部署现有的 `.env`、overlay 和密钥，不要用示例文件替换它们。升级从不轮换密钥：改动 "
"`JWT_SECRET_KEY` 会让所有人退出登录，改动 `API_KEY_SECRET` 会让所有 API key 失效，改动 "
"`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET`（或在它被替代时改动 "
"`API_KEY_SECRET`）会让后端无法启动。在不再可能回滚之前，保留升级前的 `.env`；见[升级把设置放在 `.env` "
"里的部署](deployment.md#upgrading-a-deployment-that-kept-its-settings-in-"
"env)。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:90
msgid ""
"Back up each database and check that the backup restores; see "
"[Backup](database.md#backup). The backup holds the stored secrets in "
"plaintext, so protect it like them."
msgstr "备份每个数据库，并确认备份能够恢复；见[备份](database.md#backup)。备份中以明文保存着已存储的密钥，要像保护密钥本身一样保护它。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:93
msgid ""
"Rehearse on a separate local or staging deployment with its own storage. "
"Apply the migrations with the new image ([How the schema is "
"created](database.md#how-the-schema-is-created)), start it, and check the"
" startup logs, `/health/ready`, sign-in, an existing API key, a routed "
"request and streaming. Then start the previous image on the migrated "
"database and run the same checks, since that is what a failed deploy "
"falls back to."
msgstr ""
"在使用独立存储的本地或 staging 部署上演练。先用新镜像执行迁移（[schema 如何创建](database.md#how-the-"
"schema-is-created)），再启动它，检查启动日志、`/health/ready`、登录、一个已有的 API "
"key、一次路由请求和流式输出。然后在迁移后的数据库上启动旧镜像，跑同样的检查，因为部署失败时退回的就是它。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:100
msgid ""
"Deploy with your usual method: migrate with the new image while the old "
"one serves, and restart only once that succeeded. On a stack built from "
"source, `make build` rebuilds, migrates and recreates the services; `make"
" restart` does none of that (see [What a change actually "
"requires](deployment.md#what-a-change-actually-requires)). Check the "
"running image identities and repeat the rehearsal checks before sending "
"normal traffic."
msgstr ""
"用你平常的方式部署：在旧版本继续服务时用新镜像执行迁移，成功后再重启。对从源码构建的服务栈，`make build` "
"会重新构建、迁移并重建服务；`make restart` 这些都不做（见[一项改动实际需要什么](deployment.md#what-a"
"-change-actually-requires)）。在放入正常流量之前，检查运行中的镜像标识并重复演练时的检查。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:108
msgid ""
"`make deploy` deploys published images by digest instead, and restores "
"the previous ones if acceptance fails; see [Diagnostics, deployment and "
"recovery](deployment.md#diagnostics-deployment-and-recovery)."
msgstr ""
"`make deploy` 则按摘要部署已发布的镜像，验收失败时恢复旧镜像；见[诊断、部署与恢复](deployment.md"
"#diagnostics-deployment-and-recovery)。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:112
msgid ""
"Upgrading from a release that read its site identity, branding and alert "
"rules from files, store them in the database as well: until then the new "
"release serves neutral site settings and the built-in alert thresholds. "
"See [Model and routing documents in the "
"database](configuration.md#model-and-routing-documents-in-the-database)."
msgstr ""
"如果旧版本从文件读取站点标识、品牌和告警规则，也要把它们保存到数据库中：在此之前，新版本使用中性的站点设置和内置告警阈值。见[数据库中的模型与路由文"
"档](configuration.md#model-and-routing-documents-in-the-database)。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:119
msgid ""
"A migration leaves the previous release working on the new schema, so "
"restoring the previous images and configuration is the rollback; do not "
"run the previous image's migrations. A release whose migration drops "
"something older code uses says so in its notes, and older backends then "
"refuse to start on that database. Going back past such a release means "
"restoring the pre-upgrade backup, which loses later writes. There is no "
"schema downgrade, and deleting a volume is a reset, not a rollback."
msgstr ""
"迁移会让旧版本在新 schema "
"上继续可用，所以恢复旧镜像和配置就是回滚；不要运行旧镜像的迁移。如果某个版本的迁移删除了旧代码还在用的东西，它的发布说明会写明，旧后端随后会拒绝在该数据库上启动。要回退到这样的版本之前，只能恢复升级前的备份，之后的写入会丢失。没有"
" schema 降级命令；删除卷是重置，不是回滚。"

#: ../developer/releases.md:127
msgid ""
"`make rollback` returns to the images the last accepted `make deploy` "
"replaced. Roll back only to a release with the database-backed "
"configuration: Compose no longer passes the variables an earlier release "
"read its files through."
msgstr ""
"`make rollback` 会回到最近一次被接受的 `make deploy` "
"所替换的镜像。只能回滚到使用数据库配置的版本：更早的版本通过一些变量读取文件，而 Compose 已不再传递这些变量。"
